  },
  {
   "section_number": "73.2180",
   "paragraph_path": "(a)(2)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 3,
   "body_text": "Polyethylene glycol-40 castor oil (PEG-40 castor oil). Saponification No., 60 to 70. Hydroxyl No., 63 to 78. Acid No., 2. Specific gravity, 1.05 to 1.07.",
   "content_sha256": "d63b953ee3568125964adcdec887985db69483363513672d1446148d81dfe58a",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07aab-bcd0-74c5-8272-584ab9102ddf",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c126-7e24-ade9-27f698320c86"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "73.2180",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 5,
   "body_text": "Melting point, 30.5 °C to 31.5 °C. Lead (as Pb), not more than 20 parts per million. Arsenic (as As), not more than 3 parts per million. Mercury (as Hg), not more than 1 part per million. Total color, not less than 99 percent.",
   "content_sha256": "0cbe6c8144e2c326617be8560a3aa7c3afe8895012534aed8439d25be3ecfdbc",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07aab-bcd0-7dc3-a726-6d5471e50883",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c127-77c9-9cea-3287a62cf6c1"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "73.2250",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 2,
   "body_text": "Arsenic (as As), not more than 3 parts per million. Lead (as Pb), not more than 10 parts per million. Mercury (as Hg), not more than 3 parts per million.",
   "content_sha256": "3cc3c7499d3de9a0236d277dac8d0383dcbdb5eedf648a3a60b46bef2b28229e",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07aab-bcd7-7a72-bb3f-901f18b5740e",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c136-71c5-b814-e569736491fe"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "73.2725",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 2,
   "body_text": "Lead (as Pb), not more than 20 parts per million. Arsenic (as As), not more than 3 parts per million. Mercury (as Hg), not more than 1 part per million.",
   "content_sha256": "dc31fa4737d84aa4b95b33456e775c1875a8644c75d9565af1e2adb414528094",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07aab-bd04-7423-9fea-8e516307e647",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c13f-7108-a052-e5ad1d77f797"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "74.2602a",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 2,
   "body_text": "Sum of volatile matter (at 135 °C) and chlorides and sulfates (calculated as sodium salts), not more than 18 percent. Water-insoluble matter, not more than 0.4 percent. 1-Hydroxy-9,10-anthracenedione, not more than 0.2 percent. 1,4-Dihydroxy-9,10-anthracenedione, not more than 0.2 percent. p- Toluidine, not more than 0.1 percent. p- Toluidine sulfonic acids, sodium salts, not more than 0.2 percent. Subsidiary colors, not more than 1 percent. Lead (as Pb), not more than 20 parts per million. Arsenic (as As), not more than 3 parts per million. Mercury (as Hg), not more than 1 part per million. Total color, not less than 80 percent.",
   "content_sha256": "d4f38e73800992e3bad18ad1865f37be13815ce64df34074baef3ec337a95b39",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07aab-c2d2-74ef-8d58-34dff61ff318",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c15a-79f3-bad6-f2d1eb62c316"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "740.11",
   "paragraph_path": "(a)(1)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 1,
   "body_text": "Warning—Avoid spraying in eyes. Contents under pressure. Do not puncture or incinerate. Do not store at temperature above 120 °F. Keep out of reach of children.",
   "content_sha256": "131c83341ecd63771f1a6d69be1c4b04ff0b99f8106b3d9fa0b844014100b8d2",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07ab4-7c30-7208-a94d-61c62a3c223c",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c1be-7169-956d-eda93d0b3121"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "740.11",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)(1)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 6,
   "body_text": "Warning—Use only as directed. Intentional misuse by deliberately concentrating and inhaling the contents can be harmful or fatal.",
   "content_sha256": "97657108adf6415356ee1604510a968faa83b97d548713ff8821472cb7f40c7c",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07ab4-7c39-7bdb-9473-d311fd1910f1",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c1be-762c-bd83-d921e039c610"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "740.12",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)",
   "path_ordinal": 1,
   "ordinal": 2,
   "body_text": "Caution—For external use only. Spray at least 8 inches from skin. Do not apply to broken, irritated, or itching skin. Persistent, unusual odor or discharge may indicate conditions for which a physician should be consulted. Discontinue use immediately if rash, irritation, or discomfort develops.",
   "content_sha256": "9dd949f7f8eb19fac0072bef2609163b448a343c713fda8201733c1a30be9833",
   "source_tag": "EXTRACT",
   "anchor_id": "01a07ab4-7c42-7f7e-b641-16d498f545cb",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c1ca-715d-8cb4-13fe2a4f9efb"
  },
  {
   "section_number": "740.12",
   "paragraph_path": "(b)",
   "path_ordinal": 2,
   "ordinal": 3,
   "body_text": "The sentence “Spray at least 8 inches from skin” need not be included in the cautionary statement for products whose expelled contents do not contain a liquified gas propellant such as a halocarbon or hydrocarbon propellant.",
   "content_sha256": "fcc99bba442ba7d0e221abb8e23751bd41a36e2700a13b294233df317b4db7c9",
   "source_tag": "FP",
   "anchor_id": "01a07ab4-7c42-7f7e-b641-16d498f545cb",
   "id": "01a15ddc-c1ca-7689-b402-a34a2f85c5d6"
  },
  {
